"to remote machines."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ debuginfo ເຊິ່ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍ ແລະ ກິນພື້ນທີ່ດິດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່"
"ງ coredump ໄປເຄື່ອງອື່ນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ RetraceServer."

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_RetraceServer.xml.in.h:1
msgid "Send core dump to remote retrace server for analysis"
msgstr "ສົ່ງ core dump ໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີ retrace ເພື່ອການວິເຄາະ"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_RetraceServer.xml.in.h:2
msgid ""
"Uploads coredump to a server, which generates backtrace and returns it. "
"Pros: no need for debuginfo downloads. Retrace server's database of "
"debuginfos is more complete. Retrace server may generate better backtraces. "
"Cons: coredump you upload contains all the data from the crashed program, "
"including your private data, if any."
msgstr ""
"ອັບໂຫຼດ coredump ໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີເຊິ່ງຈະສ້າງ backtrace ແລະ ສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາ. ຂໍ້ດີ: ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງດາວໂຫຼດ "
"debuginfo. ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ debuginfos ຂອງເຊີບເວີ Retrace ສົມບູນກວ່າ. ເຊີບເວີ Retrace ອາດຈະສ້າ"
"ງ backtrace ທີ່ດີກວ່າ. ຂໍ້ເສຍ: coredump ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດມີຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຂອງໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຂັດຂ້ອງ, ລວມເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວ"
"ນຕົວຂອງທ່ານນຳ (ຖ້າມີ)."

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_RetraceServer.xml.in.h:3
msgid "Retrace server URI"
msgstr "URI ຂອງເຊີບເວີ Retrace"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_RetraceServer.xml.in.h:4
msgid "Address of the retrace server"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງເຊີບເວີ retrace"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_RetraceServer.xml.in.h:5
msgid "Insecure"
msgstr "ບໍ່ປອດໄພ"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_RetraceServer.xml.in.h:6
msgid "Whether or not to use insecure connection"
msgstr "ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພຫຼືບໍ່"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_RetraceServer.xml.in.h:7
msgid ""
"Write \"insecure\" to allow insecure connection &lt;a href=\"https://"
"fedorahosted.org/abrt/wiki/AbrtRetraceServerInsecureConnection\" &gt;"
"(warning)&lt;/a&gt;"
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນ \"insecure\" ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບບໍ່ປອດໄພ &lt;a href=\"https://"
"fedorahosted.org/abrt/wiki/AbrtRetraceServerInsecureConnection\" &gt;(ຄຳເຕືອນ)"
"&lt;/a&gt;"

#: ../src/plugins/collect_xsession_errors.xml.in.h:1
msgid "Collect .xsession-errors"
msgstr "ເກັບກຳ .xsession-errors"

#: ../src/plugins/collect_xsession_errors.xml.in.h:2
msgid "Save relevant lines from ~/.xsession-errors file"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກແຖວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈາກໄຟລ໌ ~/.xsession-errors"

#: ../src/plugins/collect_xsession_errors.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
"Scans through ~/.xsession-errors file and saves those lines which contain "
"executable's name. The result is saved as 'xsession_errors' element."
msgstr ""
"ສະແກນໄຟລ໌ ~/.xsession-errors ແລະ ບັນທຶກແຖວທີ່ມີຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແລ່ນໄດ້. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນອົງປະກອ"
"ບ 'xsession_errors'."

#: ../src/plugins/https-utils.c:53
