msgstr "ກຳລັງຢຸດລໍຖ້າ %d ວິນາທີ"

#: ../src/plugins/oops-utils.c:227
msgid ""
"A kernel problem occurred because of broken BIOS. Unfortunately, such "
"problems are not fixable by kernel maintainers."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດບັນຫາກັບ kernel ເນື່ອງຈາກ BIOS ເສຍຫາຍ. ໜ້າເສຍດາຍທີ່ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງ kernel ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້"
"ໄດ້."

#: ../src/plugins/oops-utils.c:232
msgid ""
"A kernel problem occurred, but your hardware is unsupported, therefore "
"kernel maintainers are unable to fix this problem."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດບັນຫາກັບ kernel, ແຕ່ຮາດແວຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງ kernel ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄ"
"ດ້."

#: ../src/plugins/oops-utils.c:246
#, c-format
msgid ""
"A kernel problem occurred, but your kernel has been tainted (flags:%s). "
"Explanation:\n"
"%sKernel maintainers are unable to diagnose tainted reports."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດບັນຫາກັບ kernel, ແຕ່ kernel ຂອງທ່ານຖືກດັດແປງແລ້ວ (ທຸງ:%s). ຄຳອະທິບາຍ:\n"
"%sຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງ kernel ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບລາຍງານທີ່ມີການດັດແປງໄດ້."

#: ../src/plugins/oops-utils.c:254
#, c-format
msgid " Tainted modules: %s."
msgstr " ໂມດູນທີ່ຖືກດັດແປງ: %s."

